<title>USA: DSC Communications says encouraged by Q1.</title>
<headline>DSC Communications says encouraged by Q1.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSC Communications Corp said Wednesday it was encouraged that it begun the new year with comparative improvements in first quarter revenue and profitablity.</p>
<p>The company said its first quarter is usually the weakest, with improvements through the remainder of the year expected.</p>
<p>The company reported first quarter revenue of $346.2 million and a net income of $16.3 million.</p>
